1. Code derived from "LLMs-from-scratch"
----------------------------------------

Source:    https://github.com/rasbt/LLMs-from-scratch
Copyright: Copyright 2023-2026 Sebastian Raschka
License:   Apache License, Version 2.0
           (a copy is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0-LLMs-from-scratch.txt)

The following files are derived from the notebooks of that repository,
which accompany the book "Build a Large Language Model (From Scratch)" by
Sebastian Raschka (Manning, 2024). They were modified by Luigi Saetta: the
explanations were rewritten and extended, and the code was adapted to this
repository. Each file states its origin: a notebook in its first cells, a
Python module in its docstring.

  chap1/dataloader.ipynb       derived from ch02/01_main-chapter-code/dataloader.ipynb
  chap2/basic_attention.ipynb  derived from ch03/01_main-chapter-code/ch03.ipynb
  chap2/attention.ipynb        derived from ch03/01_main-chapter-code/ch03.ipynb
  chap2/causal_attention.ipynb derived from ch03/01_main-chapter-code/ch03.ipynb
  chap2/multi_head_attention.ipynb
                               derived from ch03/01_main-chapter-code/ch03.ipynb
  chap3/dummy_gpt.ipynb        derived from ch04/01_main-chapter-code/ch04.ipynb
  chap3/gpt_step_by_step.ipynb derived from ch04/01_main-chapter-code/ch04.ipynb
  build_llm/gpt2.py            derived from the code of ch03 and ch04
  build_llm/dataloaders.py     derived from the code of ch02
  chap4/first_training.py      derived from the code of ch05

