3a. Expanded Chapter 4 training corpus
--------------------------------------

The following nineteen files are modified plain-text conversions of the
Standard Ebooks editions listed below. Original literary texts are in the
public domain. Standard Ebooks contributors dedicate their contributions
to the public domain under CC0 1.0 (copy: LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt).

Changes: bodymatter XHTML converted to plain text in EPUB spine order;
chapter headings and paragraphs retained; front/back matter, notes, note
references, and Gutenberg boilerplate excluded; invisible formatting
characters removed and typographic spaces normalized. Title and author
retained. Exact chapter paths, converted SHA-256 checksums, token counts,
and edition URLs are recorded in chap4/books_manifest.json. Downloaded
texts are not committed to Git; restore with python -m chap4.prepare_books.

